<chapter>
  <title>Information &amp; Links</title>

  <section xml:id="sec-resources">
    <title>Learning More About <pretext /></title>
    <p>
      Here are some resources to help you learn more about <pretext /> and how to use it.
    </p>
    <tabular top="minor" bottom="minor" left="minor" right="minor">
      <row>
        <cell><url href="https://pretextbook.org"><pretext /> Homepage</url></cell>
        <cell>The <pretext /> homepage is a great place to start learning more about the project and its capabilities. It includes links to documentation, help forums, and more.</cell>
      </row>
      <row>
        <cell><url href="https://runestone.academy/ns/books/published/debookrs/"><pretext /> Guide</url></cell>
        <cell>The <pretext /> Guide is a comprehensive resource for learning how to use <pretext />. It includes detailed documentation, examples, and tutorials.</cell>
      </row>
      <row>
        <cell><url href="https://pretextbook.org/community.html">Help Forums</url></cell>
        <cell>The <pretext /> Help Forums are a great place to ask questions, share your work, and connect with other members of the <pretext /> community.</cell>
      </row>
      <row>
        <cell><url href="https://groups.google.com/g/pretext-announce"><pretext /> announcements</url></cell>
        <cell>Stay updated on the latest news and developments in the <pretext /> community.</cell>
      </row>
      <row>
        <cell><url href="https://github.com/pretextbook/pretext/issues">GitHub Issues</url></cell>
        <cell>Report bugs or request features on the <pretext /> GitHub repository.</cell>
      </row>
      <row>
        <cell><url href="https://discord.gg/pretext">Discord Server</url></cell>
        <cell>Join the <pretext /> Discord server for real-time discussions and support.</cell>
      </row>
      <row>
        <cell><url href="https://mathtech.org">MathTech</url></cell>
        <cell>Explore the MathTech website for additional resources and information about <pretext />.</cell>
      </row>
      <row>
        <cell><url href="https://www.youtube.com/@MathTechOrg/videos">Videos</url></cell>
        <cell>Watch tutorial videos and presentations about <pretext />.</cell>
      </row>
      <row>
        <cell><url href="https://runestone.academy/">Runestone Academy</url></cell>
        <cell>Runestone Academy is the platform that hosts interactive textbooks created with <pretext />. It provides a user-friendly interface for both authors and readers, making it easy to create, publish, and access interactive educational content.</cell>
      </row>
    </tabular>
  </section>

  <section xml:id="sec-cheatsheet">
    <title><pretext /> Cheatsheet</title>

    <introduction>
      <p>
        The tags you will reach for most often.
        These are minimal patterns you can copy and adapt.
        Replace placeholder values such as <c>T</c>, <c>def-x</c>, and <c>path.png</c> with your own content.
      </p>

      <p>
        Keep this near your keyboard.
        For fuller documentation, see
        <url href="https://pretextbook.org">pretextbook.org</url>.
      </p>
    </introduction>

    <subsection xml:id="cheatsheet-structure-formatting">
      <title>Document structure and formatting</title>

      <worksheet>
        <sbsgroup widths="15% 28% 15% 30%" margins="2% 2%">
          <sidebyside>
            <p><term>Section</term></p>
            <program language="xml">
              &lt;section&gt;
                &lt;title&gt;T&lt;/title&gt;
                ...
              &lt;/section&gt;
            </program>
            <p><term>Subsection</term></p>
            <program language="xml">
              &lt;subsection&gt;
                &lt;title&gt;T&lt;/title&gt;
                ...
              &lt;/subsection&gt;
            </program>
          </sidebyside>
          <sidebyside>
            <p><term>Paragraph</term></p>
            <program language="xml">
              &lt;p&gt;...&lt;/p&gt;
            </program>
            <p><term>Emphasis</term></p>
            <program language="xml">
              &lt;em&gt;...&lt;/em&gt;
            </program>
          </sidebyside>
        </sbsgroup>
        <p>
          <em>Text formatting</em>
          <dl>
            <li>
              <title>Emphasis</title>
              <cd><![CDATA[<em>emphasized text</em>]]></cd>
            </li>
            <li>
              <title>New term</title>
              <cd><![CDATA[<term>right triangle</term>]]></cd>
            </li>
            <li>
              <title>Inline code</title>
              <cd><![CDATA[<c>pretext build</c>]]></cd>
            </li>
            <li>
              <title>Quotation</title>
              <cd><![CDATA[<q>quoted text</q>]]></cd>
            </li>
          </dl>
        </p>
        <p>
          <em>Lists</em>
          <dl>
            <li>
              <title>Bulleted list</title>
              <cd><![CDATA[<ul>
          <li><p>item</p></li>
          <li><p>item</p></li>
          </ul>]]></cd>
            </li>
            <li>
              <title>Numbered list</title>
              <cd><![CDATA[<ol>
          <li><p>item</p></li>
          <li><p>item</p></li>
          </ol>]]></cd>
            </li>
            <li>
              <title>Description list</title>
              <cd><![CDATA[<dl>
          <li>
            <title>T</title>
            <p>...</p>
          </li>
          </dl>]]></cd>
            </li>
          </dl>
        </p>
      </worksheet>
    </subsection>

    <subsection xml:id="cheatsheet-math">
      <title>Math</title>
      <p>
        <em>Math</em>
        <dl>
          <li>
            <title>Inline math</title>
            <cd><![CDATA[<m>x^2 + 1</m>]]></cd>
          </li>
          <li>
            <title>Display math</title>
            <cd><![CDATA[<me>\int_0^1 f(x)\,dx</me>]]></cd>
          </li>
          <li>
            <title>Numbered math</title>
            <cd><![CDATA[<men>e^{i\pi} + 1 = 0</men>]]></cd>
          </li>
          <li>
            <title>Multi-line display</title>
            <cd><![CDATA[<md>
        <mrow>a^2 + b^2 \amp = c^2</mrow>
        <mrow>x^2 + y^2 \amp = z^2</mrow>
        </md>]]></cd>
          </li>
        </dl>
      </p>
    </subsection>

    <subsection xml:id="cheatsheet-common-blocks">
      <title>Common blocks</title>
      <p>
        <em>Common blocks</em>
        <dl>
          <li>
            <title>Definition</title>
            <cd><![CDATA[<definition xml:id="def-x">
        <statement><p>...</p></statement>
        </definition>]]></cd>
          </li>
          <li>
            <title>Theorem</title>
            <cd><![CDATA[<theorem xml:id="thm-x">
        <statement><p>...</p></statement>
        <proof><p>...</p></proof>
        </theorem>]]></cd>
          </li>
          <li>
            <title>Example</title>
            <cd><![CDATA[<example xml:id="ex-x">
        <title>T</title>
        <statement><p>...</p></statement>
        <solution><p>...</p></solution>
        </example>]]></cd>
          </li>
          <li>
            <title>Remark</title>
            <cd><![CDATA[<remark>
        <p>...</p>
        </remark>]]></cd>
          </li>
        </dl>
      </p>
    </subsection>

    <subsection xml:id="cheatsheet-exercises">
      <title>Exercises</title>
      <p>
        <em>Exercises</em>
        <dl>
          <li>
            <title>Simple exercise</title>
            <cd><![CDATA[<exercise xml:id="exr-x">
        <statement><p>...</p></statement>
        </exercise>]]></cd>
          </li>
          <li>
            <title>Exercise with hint and answer</title>
            <cd><![CDATA[<exercise xml:id="exr-y">
        <statement><p>...</p></statement>
        <hint><p>...</p></hint>
        <answer><p>...</p></answer>
        </exercise>]]></cd>
          </li>
          <li>
            <title>Exercise with solution</title>
            <cd><![CDATA[<exercise xml:id="exr-z">
        <statement><p>...</p></statement>
        <solution><p>...</p></solution>
        </exercise>]]></cd>
          </li>
        </dl>
      </p>
    </subsection>

    <subsection xml:id="cheatsheet-links-refs">
      <title>Document structure and formatting</title>
      <p>
        <em>Links</em>
        <dl>
          <li>
            <title>External URL</title>
            <cd><![CDATA[<url href="https://example.com"/>]]></cd>
          </li>
          <li>
            <title>Labeled link</title>
            <cd><![CDATA[<url href="https://example.com">click here</url>]]></cd>
          </li>
        </dl>
      </p>
      <p>
        <em>Cross-references</em>
        <dl>
          <li>
            <title>Link to an <c>xml:id</c></title>
            <cd><![CDATA[<xref ref="def-x"/>]]></cd>
          </li>
          <li>
            <title>Custom cross-reference text</title>
            <cd><![CDATA[<xref ref="def-x" text="custom">our definition</xref>]]></cd>
          </li>
        </dl>
      </p>
    </subsection>

    <subsection xml:id="cheatsheet-figures-images">
      <title>Figures and images</title>
      <p>
        <em>Figures and images</em>
        <dl>
          <li>
            <title>Image</title>
            <p>
              <cd><![CDATA[<image source="path.png" width="50%">
          <shortdescription>Brief alt text.</shortdescription>
          </image>]]></cd>
            </p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <title>Image with long description</title>
            <p>
              <cd><![CDATA[<image source="path.png" width="50%">
          <shortdescription>Brief alt text.</shortdescription>
          <description>
            <p>Longer description if the image carries substantial information.</p>
          </description>
          </image>]]></cd>
            </p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <title>Figure with caption</title>
            <p>
              <cd><![CDATA[<figure xml:id="fig-x">
          <caption>My caption.</caption>
          <image source="path.png" width="50%">
            <shortdescription>Brief alt text.</shortdescription>
          </image>
          </figure>]]></cd>
            </p>
          </li>
        </dl>
      </p>
    </subsection>

    <subsection xml:id="cheatsheet-common-mistakes">
      <title>Common mistakes</title>
      <p>
        <em>Common mistakes</em>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <p>
              Wrap list item text in paragraphs:
              <c>&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;text&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;</c>.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <p>
              Close every tag:
              <c>&lt;/example&gt;</c>, not <c>&lt;/examp&gt;</c>.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <p>
              Use <c>xml:id</c>, not <c>id</c>, when you want a stable target for an <c>&lt;xref/&gt;</c>.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <p>
              In aligned math, use <c>\amp</c> for the alignment marker.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <p>
              Save and rebuild or refresh your preview after changes.
            </p>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </p>
    </subsection>

  </section>

</chapter>